        "content": "<p>alexcrichton opened <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/issues/15332\">issue #15332</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>This test:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"WebAssembly\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">component</span> <span class=\"nv\">$A</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">module</span> <span class=\"nv\">$dtor</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">tag</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n      <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"dtor\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">param</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">throw</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$dtor</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$dtor</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">type</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">resource</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">rep</span> <span class=\"kt\">i32</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">dtor</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$dtor</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"dtor\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n    <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$t.new</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err