/span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">canon</span> <span class=\"err\">l</span><span class=\"nb\">if</span><span class=\"err\">t</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">core</span> <span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$b</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$A</span><span class=\"p\">))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$b</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instantiate</span> <span class=\"nv\">$B</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">with</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"a\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">instance</span> <span class=\"nv\">$a</span><span class=\"p\">))))</span>\n  <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">export</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"k\">func</span> <span class=\"nv\">$b</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)))</span>\n\n<span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">assert_trap</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">invoke</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"run\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"s2\">\"uncaught exception propagated out of component\"</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n</code></pre></div>\n<p>passes without guest debugging, but fails with it:</p>\n<div class=\"codehilite\" data-code-language=\"Rust\"><pre><span></span><code><span class=\"cp\">$</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">cargo</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">run</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"w\"> </span><span class=\"n\">wast</span><span class=\"w\"> </span>